== Theorem == {{:Order of Subgroup Divides Order of Group}}
== Proof == <onlyinclude> The left cosets of $H$ in $G$ split $G$ into parts, and each part has as many elements as $H$ has. So the order of $G$ is the number of cosets times the order of $H$. {{qed}} </onlyinclude>
[[Category:Order of Subgroup Divides Order of Group]]
